{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026c68tdPpoLz1795840834.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>接連有政府部門受黑客攻擊，被盜取個人資料，數字政策辦公室指高度關注。</p><p></p><p>針對近期出現利用人工智能(AI)攻擊網上系統趨勢，數字辦指已指示各部門，優先檢查涉及個人及敏感資料的重要系統，又要求部門及承辦商切實履行網絡安全責任，確保防禦措施到位，並應強化事故通報機制，第一時間向數字辦報告，並作出應對。數字辦亦會提供支援，守護政府系統及數據安全。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T05:34:10.338989+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T04:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T08:29:20.947419+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T05:27:21.118479+00:00","content_hash":"34729320da2d04b49714263567e1935d040421aef641b234d4e3db40ee225031","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}